				<h3><a name="About_Enya"></a>Who is Enya?</h3>

				<a target="_blank" href="https://www.amazon.com/Enya/e/B000APUOQK?ref=sr_ntt_srch_lnk_2&amp;qid=1641169744&amp;sr=1-2&_encoding=UTF8&tag=enylyrallenys-20&linkCode=ur2&linkId=d541620b701d12b789cae68caf79229e&camp=1789&creative=9325"><img src="enya-home2023-2.jpg" alt="Stream or download Enya songs" class="float-left width-33 rounded" /></a>

				<p><a href="enya-biography.html"><strong>Enya</strong></a> is a Grammy Award Irish singer, often labeled as &ldquo;New Age&rdquo;. Singing and playing all instruments by herself, she made world hits such as &ldquo;<a href="a-day-without-rain.html#Only_Time">Only Time</a>&rdquo;, &ldquo;<a href="enya-other.html#May_It_Be">May It
					Be</a>&rdquo; and &ldquo;<a href="watermark.html#Orinoco_Flow">Orinoco Flow (Sail Away)</a>&rdquo;.
					<br /> <a href="enya-biography.html"><strong>More about Enya &raquo;</strong></a></p>

				<p>Artists like Enya: <a href="new-age-music.html">Celtic Woman</a>, <a href="new-age-music.html">Clannad</a> (Enya's family band), <a href="new-age-music.html">Loreena McKennitt</a>, <a href="new-age-music.html">Vangelis</a> and <a href="new-age-music.html">Yanni</a>.</p>

